1
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:37,040
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪, ORIGINAL NOVEL

3
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,920
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:45,600
XUANSHI PALACE

5
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,800
Wei Rao,

6
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,400
before we see the Emperor,

7
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:58,600
do you have anything to tell me?

8
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,600
I…

9
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:15,720
Summoning the Heir to the Duke of Ying
and his wife, Lady Wei.

10
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,840
What do you want to hear from me, My Lord?

11
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:29,160
Once we're inside the hall,
you don't need to speak.

12
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,160
I will handle it.

13
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:34,960
XUANSHI PALACE

14
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:57,120
Lu Zhuo pays his respects to Your Majesty.

15
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:01,360
All right. Not a formal session today.

16
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:04,160
There's no need for such formalities.

17
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,080
You may rise.

18
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,320
Lu Zhuo,

19
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,840
I invited you both here today.

20
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:15,760
I meant to act as a peacemaker

21
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:20,040
to resolve the grudge and end
the hostility among your three families.

22
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,680
Prince Rong is His Majesty's brother.

23
00:03:23,600 --> 00:03:25,760
The Lu and Han families
are pillars of the court.

24
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:29,120
For the three families to
harbor animosity and argue endlessly,

25
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:31,680
how is that proper conduct for subjects?

26
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:35,480
This must all be a misunderstanding.

27
00:03:35,560 --> 00:03:37,760
I would also like to ask Prince Rong

28
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,520
what kind of misunderstanding it was

29
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:43,040
that made you disregard
etiquette and propriety

30
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,760
to openly intrude
into my ancestral temple.

31
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,600
I am guilty.

32
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:52,000
The servant, Anfu,

33
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:54,040
accused them of
hiding imperial ritual vessels.

34
00:03:54,640 --> 00:03:55,920
I dare not to act on my own,

35
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:57,760
so I immediately
reported it to Prince Rong.

36
00:03:57,840 --> 00:04:00,160
His Highness has a fiery temper.

37
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,760
How can he tolerate such overstepping?

38
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:04,440
He rushed straight to
confront the Lu family.

39
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:06,880
Who would have thought?
It was actually that servant,

40
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:08,720
mistreated by his masters,

41
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:12,000
and made up a huge lie
to frame the Lu family.

42
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:15,080
All of this had
nothing to do with Prince Rong.

43
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:17,040
It was all my fault. I misjudged

44
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,600
and trusted the wrong man.

45
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:23,480
I deserve death. A thousand deaths.

46
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:26,600
To think that Anfu, an illiterate servant,

47
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,920
actually knew how to
identify imperial vessels.

48
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:31,640
This is truly an extraordinary tale.

49
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:36,880
Lord Lu is right to lecture me.
It was all my fault.

50
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:40,000
Your Majesty, in my view,

51
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:42,160
we must capture Anfu
and torture him severely.

52
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:45,120
I doubt he'll keep quiet about
who's behind it.

53
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:47,360
Why pretend, Lord Han?

54
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:50,320
Don't you know
Anfu was thrown into the imperial prison

55
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:53,320
and then dropped dead right there?

56
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,360
He is dead?

57
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:59,000
This is clearly silencing a witness.

58
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:02,080
Your Majesty,

59
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:04,400
I request that the Commandant's Office
look into this case.

60
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:09,200
So the truth can come to light soon
and clear the name of loyal subjects.

61
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:13,120
Over a hundred people in the Lu family,
they can all testify to it.

62
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:15,280
You intruded into my ancestral temple,

63
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:17,120
destroyed our spirit tablets,
and insulted our ancestors.

64
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,120
Which of these wronged you?

65
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:22,400
How dare you shamelessly
claim your name to be cleared?

66
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:25,000
Lord Lu, it was all because I was foolish

67
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:26,520
and deceived by others.

68
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:29,600
Punish me however you like,

69
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,200
it's your call.

70
00:05:33,320 --> 00:05:34,200
All right.

71
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:38,080
There are no witnesses,
only verbal claims.

72
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:41,200
Whose side do you expect me to believe?

73
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:45,360
In this hall today,
there is more than one victim.

74
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,960
Lady Wei, you were also wronged.

75
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:51,600
I can have Han family compensate you.

76
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,880
So, Your Majesty,

77
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,600
are you shielding
Prince Rong and Han Liao?

78
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:58,560
Insolence!

79
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,400
Lu Zhuo,

80
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:03,440
His Majesty knows
your grandfather is stubborn

81
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:05,040
and inflexible,

82
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,960
which is why he asked
you here to make peace.

83
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:10,840
So, you also want to go
against His Majesty's kindness?

84
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:13,280
I have decided on the compensation.

85
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,640
I only ask for Your Majesty's approval.

86
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:17,240
Speak.

87
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:22,840
I beg Your Majesty to grant permission
to chop off Prince Rong's left foot

88
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:27,080
and both of Lord Han's feet
as compensation.

89
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:39,040
ZHAOYANG PALACE

90
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:45,560
Your Ladyship, are you worried that
you idea to His Majesty won't work?

91
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:49,480
The Empress Dowager did
her best to protect Prince Rong.

92
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:51,240
His Majesty didn't
want to break with his mother

93
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:54,200
and bear the name of an unfilial son,
so he could only release Prince Rong.

94
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:57,080
Besides, everything is
over with the witness dead.

95
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,760
No matter how
dissatisfied the Lu family is,

96
00:06:59,840 --> 00:07:01,440
they cannot oppose the Empress Dowager.

97
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:04,240
Then you must be worried
about Yinggu, who left the palace.

98
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:08,280
Yinggu is just visiting
my mother at Xianzhuang.

99
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,880
Why would I worry about her?

100
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:12,600
Stop being cheeky here.

101
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,840
Hurry to Xuanshi Palace
and see if Rao has arrived.

102
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,800
Yes, I'm going now.

103
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:18,520
Go quickly.

104
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:22,560
ZHAOYANG PALACE

105
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:26,040
You vicious woman,

106
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:28,400
- how dare you!
- Shut up.

107
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:33,600
Let her talk. I want to hear it.
I have pardoned them.

108
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:37,320
What crime are you charging them with
to cut off their feet?

109
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:39,720
Wei Rao.

110
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:45,560
Your Majesty,

111
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,720
The witness, Anfu, is dead,

112
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:50,320
making it hard to prove
Han's false accusation.

113
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:53,280
But the innocent woman
abducted by Lord Han is still alive

114
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,240
and can testify at any time.

115
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:58,160
Lord Han's violated two laws.

116
00:07:58,960 --> 00:08:01,760
One, abetting others
in the commission of a crime.

117
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:05,080
He forcibly abducted a commoner woman
and schemed to do harm.

118
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:08,120
Two, the guilty injuring the innocent.

119
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:10,320
The Lu family tried to save her
and got beaten instead.

120
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:12,800
For the Han family,
this doubles the offense.

121
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:15,360
But I was the one got beaten and injured.

122
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:16,640
By our laws,

123
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:19,080
anyone who abducts a woman without cause

124
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:23,680
her rescuer can kill you on the spot
with impunity.

125
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,400
Your Majesty!

126
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:29,120
If a commoner abducts a woman,
a left foot shall be cut off.

127
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:32,760
For an official, that makes it worse,
and both his feet get cut off.

128
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:36,760
Accomplices share
the same guilt as the abductor.

129
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:38,720
Lord Han bore full responsibility.

130
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:41,039
Prince Rong was
deceived and acted as an accomplice.

131
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:42,520
The mastermind loses both feet,

132
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:46,400
and the accomplice loses his left foot.
This is already lenient treatment.

133
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:50,200
When a prince breaks the law,
he is as guilty as a commoner.

134
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:54,480
If Your Majesty spares them today,
it tells the people of the realm that

135
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:55,520
abducting is guiltless,

136
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:58,400
and flouting the law carries no fault.

137
00:08:58,480 --> 00:09:00,960
If a royal brother and your favorite
subject defy the law,

138
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:04,560
who in the realm will obey
the laws of the state

139
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:06,000
and follow
Your Majesty's commands in the future?

140
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:08,520
Shut up! I'll chop you down.

141
00:09:09,800 --> 00:09:10,720
You…

142
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:14,600
Your Majesty, forgive me.

143
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:16,720
It is not the Lu family
demanding these three feet.

144
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,400
It is the state's law that demands them.

145
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:22,720
To uphold Your Majesty's
authority and imperial dignity,

146
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:24,320
it has to be done.

147
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:30,480
Well done. Well said.

148
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:32,720
Though sharp-tongued,

149
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:35,040
what you say is well-reasoned.

150
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:39,560
However, my word is final,
and I have promised the Empress Dowager

151
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,880
that I will pardon them.

152
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:44,040
What do you propose, then?

153
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:47,200
Then, please grant permission,
Your Majesty,

154
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:51,440
allowing Prince Rong and the Han family
redeem their crimes with gold.

155
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:53,240
- How arrogant!
- Granted.

156
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:55,240
What?

157
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:58,200
Do you wish to lose
your left foot instead?

158
00:10:01,520 --> 00:10:02,640
I believe

159
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:05,640
Prince Rong's new estate
in the east of the city

160
00:10:05,720 --> 00:10:07,520
- will suffice.
- You!

161
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,080
Take it.

162
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,200
Lord Han.

163
00:10:20,160 --> 00:10:21,480
I am willing to offer 20,000 gold.

164
00:10:22,320 --> 00:10:24,760
I hear the Han family
has 500 mu of fertile land

165
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,440
at the foot of Mount Yaowang.

166
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,360
Only enough for his left foot.

167
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:35,640
Then I ask Your Majesty
to chop off Lord Han's right foot instead.

168
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:39,840
The mountain estate and
300 servants included,

169
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:42,360
all yours, your Ladyship.

170
00:10:43,240 --> 00:10:47,280
If only you would show mercy
and spare my right foot.

171
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,080
Death may be spared,
yet punishment cannot be evaded.

172
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:54,920
Your Majesty, please bear witness for me.
Don't let them deny it.

173
00:10:55,880 --> 00:10:58,280
Your gold and land
may have saved your feet

174
00:10:58,800 --> 00:11:01,640
but serving a month of penal labor
is still unavoidable.

175
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:04,160
- You…
- Fine.

176
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:07,160
We shall this day bear witness
on behalf of all three families.

177
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:10,000
Prince Rong shall
forfeit one year of stipend.

178
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:13,320
Han Liao shall serve
one month of hard labor.

179
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:16,360
If anyone break or deny it,

180
00:11:16,440 --> 00:11:19,280
I will chop off a left foot from them.

181
00:11:20,880 --> 00:11:22,160
All clear now?

182
00:11:24,200 --> 00:11:25,920
- Yes.
- Yes.

183
00:11:37,360 --> 00:11:40,640
XUANSHI PALACE

184
00:11:40,720 --> 00:11:42,160
This is my first time seeing

185
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:44,640
anyone dare to bargain
in the Xuanshi Palace.

186
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:47,760
If His Majesty simply
wanted to favor Prince Rong,

187
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:51,160
he could have just issued an edict.
Why ask us to come here?

188
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:55,640
He invited you, meaning
he wants a justice for the Lu family.

189
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:59,120
If justice cannot be settled with lives,

190
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:02,160
then it shall be compensated with wealth.

191
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:04,720
Either way, we can't suffer for nothing.

192
00:12:04,800 --> 00:12:06,800
As for whether to show mercy,

193
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:10,000
His Majesty only said no sentence today,

194
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:14,440
not that the Lu family
can't take revenge in the future.

195
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:18,800
Grandfather would certainly
not accept such worldly possessions.

196
00:12:20,320 --> 00:12:22,160
Lu as the main victim does not want them.

197
00:12:22,680 --> 00:12:24,240
I, as the minor victim, certainly do.

198
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:27,240
I don't have your family's
wealth and power.

199
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,800
Demanding them for yourself, huh?

200
00:12:30,920 --> 00:12:32,760
No wonder you haggled over every bit.

201
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:34,760
You really are…

202
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:37,360
Greetings, Lord Lu and Lady Lu.

203
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:40,000
My mistress invites
you for a conversation, Lady Lu.

204
00:12:40,800 --> 00:12:42,200
May I ask who your mistress is?

205
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:44,720
My mistress is Lady Li of Zhaoyang Palace.

206
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:56,520
You haven't eaten anything all day,

207
00:12:57,680 --> 00:12:59,280
and waited in full dress for two hours

208
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:01,800
Your stomach ailment has recurred.

209
00:13:05,800 --> 00:13:07,320
My wife is feeling unwell.

210
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:08,480
I'm afraid she might embarrass herself
in front of your Ladyship.

211
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:10,200
We must come pay our respects another day.

212
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:11,680
Please ask Lady Li to forgive us.

213
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,240
Rao.

214
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:18,920
Rao.

215
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:41,880
Rao.

216
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:44,560
Lord Lu.

217
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:46,480
Pardon my intrusion.

218
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:50,680
Is she sick?

219
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:53,200
How can she bear
the jolt of a carriage while ill?

220
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:55,440
Bring her to my palace at once,
and ask for an imperial physician.

221
00:13:56,280 --> 00:13:57,440
This is the imperial palace,

222
00:13:58,320 --> 00:14:00,520
so I dare not breach etiquette.
Please return, Your Ladyship.

223
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:03,760
Mother and daughter have been
separated for years with few reunions.

224
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:06,520
A sudden meeting
inevitably causes distress.

225
00:14:07,280 --> 00:14:08,520
Please do not blame her, Lady Li.

226
00:14:08,600 --> 00:14:10,880
Too many ears here. Not the place to talk.

227
00:14:11,680 --> 00:14:13,160
If your Ladyship wishes to meet,

228
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:14,360
please find another time.

229
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:16,760
I will take Rao back home first.

230
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:19,200
- I won't allow it.
- Please wait, Lord Lu.

231
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:27,880
My Lord, His Majesty's
got a unfinished <i>weiqi</i> game.

232
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:29,160
He asked you back to the palace.

233
00:14:29,840 --> 00:14:31,920
Lady Lu may rest
in Zhaoyang Palace for now.

234
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,920
My wife's old illness
has suddenly flared up.

235
00:14:35,120 --> 00:14:36,200
I will see His Majesty
right after I take her home.

236
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:38,680
Apologize to His Majesty on my behalf.

237
00:14:38,760 --> 00:14:41,800
Lady Lu is ill. We've got plenty of
imperial physicians here.

238
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:44,520
How can His Majesty
be made to wait for a subject?

239
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:46,040
Lu Zhuo,

240
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:51,400
you repeatedly stop us from being close.

241
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,840
What are your intentions?

242
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:56,480
Pay no attention.

243
00:14:56,560 --> 00:15:00,520
Lord Lu, you must not.
You must not defy an imperial decree.

244
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:07,280
Put me down.

245
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:09,280
Wei Rao.

246
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:24,120
There is no need, Lady Li.

247
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:27,880
His Majesty must asked for you
with something important.

248
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:30,120
Do not delay your work for me.

249
00:15:32,040 --> 00:15:33,560
I will wait for you at Zhaoyang Palace.

250
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:35,520
Alright.

251
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:39,080
I will pick you up right after I finish.

252
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:43,880
Go on and tend to your affairs.

253
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:45,760
I will take good care of Rao.

254
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:49,920
Lady Li, palace rules state that
family visits are limited to a quarter.

255
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:51,360
We must not delay.

256
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:53,480
Alright, spare me the nagging.

257
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:56,320
Someone, bring my palanquin.

258
00:15:57,000 --> 00:15:59,440
Lady Lu will ride with me.

259
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:00,680
Let's go.

260
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:07,120
Lord Lu,

261
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:09,800
this way, please.

262
00:16:22,960 --> 00:16:24,880
THE HOUR OF WEI

263
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:31,880
Your Ladyship,

264
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:33,200
this stomach ailment
is a chronic condition

265
00:16:33,280 --> 00:16:34,360
caused by years of irregular eating

266
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:38,560
and suppressed emotions.
It cannot be cured overnight.

267
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:40,360
We must use acupuncture

268
00:16:40,440 --> 00:16:42,520
along with carefully
prepared medicinal food.

269
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:45,560
To cure this illness,
we should go slowly rather than rush.

270
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:47,320
Go write the prescription.

271
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:48,960
Yes.

272
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:54,280
Not my place to sit here.

273
00:16:59,400 --> 00:17:01,160
Darned the Earl of Cheng'an's residence.

274
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:03,400
How did they take care of you

275
00:17:04,319 --> 00:17:06,520
to let you suffer from such an illness?

276
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:10,040
Was Old Madam Wei bad to you?

277
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:13,119
Or did Lady Guo dare to treat you harshly?

278
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:16,520
Or was it that useless uncle of yours?

279
00:17:16,599 --> 00:17:18,240
No matter who it was,

280
00:17:20,079 --> 00:17:21,319
Mother will settle this for you.

281
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:25,920
Grandmother, Uncle, and Aunt
were all very good to me.

282
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:50,280
Rao,

283
00:17:51,080 --> 00:17:51,920
turn around.

284
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:55,400
Let me look at you.

285
00:18:14,080 --> 00:18:15,680
Good to you?

286
00:18:17,320 --> 00:18:20,120
If they were good to you,
would you be so skinny?

287
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:23,360
Would they make you marry
a dying man for luck?

288
00:18:23,880 --> 00:18:25,240
Do not lie to me.

289
00:18:26,760 --> 00:18:29,880
I broke my way out
of the suffocating mansion.

290
00:18:30,520 --> 00:18:33,240
Those people speak sweet words,

291
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:37,280
but they are full of hypocrisy
and schemes.

292
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:40,920
Rao,

293
00:18:41,520 --> 00:18:43,000
your face is so pale.

294
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:46,760
Your hands are so cold. Are you trembling?

295
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:58,200
Rao,

296
00:18:59,040 --> 00:19:02,640
I know you hate me, blame me

297
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:04,960
that you don't want to see me. I know.

298
00:19:07,360 --> 00:19:08,400
But…

299
00:19:10,560 --> 00:19:13,120
I miss you every day.

300
00:19:14,320 --> 00:19:16,400
I have never
forgotten you for a single day.

301
00:19:18,360 --> 00:19:19,400
My daughter…

302
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:23,320
You are my daughter.

303
00:19:30,320 --> 00:19:32,960
Rao, do not cry. Do not cry.

304
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:34,800
It is all my fault.

305
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:37,400
How did I end up making you cry?

306
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:42,200
You were still young when I left,
so you do not remember me.

307
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:46,360
But every time your grandmother

308
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:49,280
took you to
the Eldest Princess's Residence,

309
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:54,280
I would go and
secretly take a look at you.

310
00:19:55,760 --> 00:19:59,560
I know you, my daughter, is a real beauty.

311
00:20:00,320 --> 00:20:02,520
I knew you were betrothed to Lu Zhuo.

312
00:20:03,120 --> 00:20:04,920
What I did not know

313
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,960
was that the Empress Dowager, the hag,

314
00:20:09,080 --> 00:20:11,160
would make you
marry him to ward off bad luck.

315
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:14,240
By the time I found out about all this,
it was already too late.

316
00:20:14,320 --> 00:20:15,520
Lady Li.

317
00:20:15,600 --> 00:20:18,480
She is just a narrow-minded hag.

318
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,240
If she hadn't kept interfering

319
00:20:20,840 --> 00:20:22,280
how could we be seperated

320
00:20:22,360 --> 00:20:25,560
for so many years
and hardly ever seen each other?

321
00:20:26,840 --> 00:20:28,480
She dislikes the Zhou family.

322
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:30,600
How could she treat you well?

323
00:20:32,320 --> 00:20:35,800
Thankfully, Lu Zhuo
was not destined for a short life.

324
00:20:37,320 --> 00:20:38,600
Otherwise,

325
00:20:38,680 --> 00:20:41,320
you would have become
a widow right after getting married,

326
00:20:42,520 --> 00:20:44,560
following right in my footsteps.

327
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:48,880
Aman,

328
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:51,280
Rao was terrified and
hasn't eaten anything

329
00:20:51,360 --> 00:20:52,960
which triggered her illness.

330
00:20:53,760 --> 00:20:56,000
Go and prepare some pastries.

331
00:20:56,080 --> 00:20:57,400
Yes.

332
00:21:01,640 --> 00:21:04,480
Just have a little bit with me, alright?

333
00:21:08,360 --> 00:21:11,320
ZHAOYANG PALACE

334
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:23,840
Here.

335
00:21:40,240 --> 00:21:41,240
It is not to your taste?

336
00:21:44,280 --> 00:21:46,960
Not as delicious as
the ones at Wei Residence?

337
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:50,480
If you do not like it, leave it here.

338
00:21:51,080 --> 00:21:52,440
I will have them make it again.

339
00:21:53,040 --> 00:21:55,600
Your Ladyship,
it is almost the end for the visit.

340
00:22:00,520 --> 00:22:02,880
Aman, go fetch my things.

341
00:22:11,840 --> 00:22:12,760
Look,

342
00:22:12,840 --> 00:22:15,600
these are all my fine treasures. Look.

343
00:22:15,680 --> 00:22:18,360
Look at these. Which one do you like?

344
00:22:21,560 --> 00:22:22,680
Is this one pretty?

345
00:22:31,560 --> 00:22:32,400
No.

346
00:22:40,000 --> 00:22:41,120
Do not move.

347
00:22:44,320 --> 00:22:45,560
It looks beautiful.

348
00:22:46,920 --> 00:22:50,680
Not just these. There are also gold and
jade treasures in the storeroom.

349
00:22:51,200 --> 00:22:52,560
I'm leaving all of them for you.

350
00:22:55,440 --> 00:22:56,280
Back then,

351
00:22:57,160 --> 00:22:59,080
if he hadn't promised

352
00:22:59,760 --> 00:23:02,640
that he would treat you well

353
00:23:03,440 --> 00:23:05,960
and stand up for you
when your father is gone,

354
00:23:07,120 --> 00:23:09,040
who would care to
live in this golden cage,

355
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:13,840
controlled by others all day long.
Nowhere to be free.

356
00:23:14,560 --> 00:23:15,520
All these things

357
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:19,040
- should be his compensation to you.
- Your Ladyship, mind your words.

358
00:23:22,680 --> 00:23:25,120
Is calling me your Mother too much to ask?

359
00:23:34,960 --> 00:23:36,960
Your Ladyship, the time has come.

360
00:23:37,040 --> 00:23:39,280
It is time to see her out of the palace.

361
00:23:42,560 --> 00:23:45,240
- Rao,
- I am grateful for your immense kindness.

362
00:23:45,320 --> 00:23:48,320
I shall take my leave now.
Please take care of yourself.

363
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:50,120
Rao.

364
00:23:51,920 --> 00:23:53,000
Rao.

365
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:57,640
- Rao!
- Your Ladyship, the palace has its rules.

366
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:59,400
Any further delay
will disturb the Empress Dowager.

367
00:23:59,480 --> 00:24:01,280
That would also be bad for Lady Lu.

368
00:24:01,360 --> 00:24:02,880
Please don't make things difficult for me.

369
00:24:02,960 --> 00:24:03,840
Get out!

370
00:24:05,800 --> 00:24:06,840
Rao.

371
00:24:07,640 --> 00:24:09,080
Rao.

372
00:24:13,960 --> 00:24:15,320
ZHAOYANG PALACE

373
00:24:54,440 --> 00:24:57,560
Look at you.
You longed so much to see your daughter,

374
00:24:58,240 --> 00:25:00,320
yet now that you have,
are you still not happy?

375
00:25:00,840 --> 00:25:03,400
Go away! I never want to see you again.

376
00:25:03,480 --> 00:25:04,680
How impudent!

377
00:25:04,760 --> 00:25:07,040
Here. Strike me.

378
00:25:07,120 --> 00:25:08,000
Once I am dead,

379
00:25:09,120 --> 00:25:11,200
have your gray-haired
wet nurse come into the palace,

380
00:25:12,040 --> 00:25:14,360
carry me out rolling in a tattered mat,
then bury me.

381
00:25:15,840 --> 00:25:18,600
That would end
our ill-fated bond in this life.

382
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:21,400
In the next life,

383
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:24,200
even if I were born an animal,

384
00:25:24,280 --> 00:25:26,520
I would never live in
this golden cage of yours.

385
00:25:27,040 --> 00:25:28,680
I would rather have
thorn hairpins and coarse clothes,

386
00:25:29,280 --> 00:25:30,800
plain tea and simple rice.

387
00:25:31,680 --> 00:25:34,800
It'd be better than being separated
from my child and becoming strangers.

388
00:25:34,880 --> 00:25:36,560
It'd be far better than

389
00:25:37,080 --> 00:25:39,560
the day my beauty fades and love wanes,

390
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:40,880
and I become tiresome to others.

391
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:44,480
Come, let me look at you.

392
00:25:45,080 --> 00:25:47,120
You are so beautiful,

393
00:25:47,200 --> 00:25:49,680
so how could you have
lost beauty and faded love?

394
00:25:49,760 --> 00:25:51,280
Nonsense.

395
00:25:51,360 --> 00:25:52,760
Then why do you forbid me
from seeing my daughter?

396
00:25:55,640 --> 00:26:00,400
Fu, she looks too much
like her birth father.

397
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:03,720
I don't want you dwelling on him.

398
00:26:04,440 --> 00:26:06,000
It just makes you sad for no reason.

399
00:26:07,920 --> 00:26:10,560
She could have been our daughter.

400
00:26:10,640 --> 00:26:11,840
Whose fault is all this?

401
00:26:14,960 --> 00:26:18,080
All right, it is all my fault.

402
00:26:18,160 --> 00:26:19,920
You promised me

403
00:26:20,560 --> 00:26:23,200
that you would treat
my daughter as your own,

404
00:26:24,080 --> 00:26:26,800
that you would make her
the most noble young lady in the world.

405
00:26:27,680 --> 00:26:28,840
Did you keep your promise?

406
00:26:32,400 --> 00:26:35,160
Fu, I asked you to stay away

407
00:26:36,280 --> 00:26:37,480
is to protect her.

408
00:26:39,040 --> 00:26:40,280
Protect her?

409
00:26:41,160 --> 00:26:44,320
You are clearly afraid of
the Empress Dowager in Changle Palace.

410
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:46,880
Yet you know very well.

411
00:26:46,960 --> 00:26:48,680
Even if you are the Emperor.

412
00:26:48,760 --> 00:26:51,760
Even if you have given
all your filial devotion

413
00:26:51,840 --> 00:26:53,760
and offered
everything eagerly at her feet.

414
00:26:54,440 --> 00:26:57,720
She could only see her eldest son
and Prince Rong in her eyes.

415
00:26:57,800 --> 00:26:59,200
There is no place for you, isn't it?

416
00:26:59,280 --> 00:27:01,520
Zhou Fu, you've gone too far!

417
00:27:01,600 --> 00:27:03,800
Because she is your mother,

418
00:27:03,880 --> 00:27:07,160
I yielded in everything
and backed down at every turn.

419
00:27:07,240 --> 00:27:09,440
But I am a mother, too.

420
00:27:10,520 --> 00:27:11,600
From now on,

421
00:27:12,120 --> 00:27:15,160
I will never let Rao suffer
anything like the lucky marriage.

422
00:27:16,400 --> 00:27:17,880
If anyone dares to bully my daughter,

423
00:27:18,480 --> 00:27:21,520
I will take up swords
and fight the whole world.

424
00:27:21,600 --> 00:27:23,920
I will kill every single one who comes.

425
00:27:24,000 --> 00:27:25,440
Try me if you don't believe it.

426
00:27:26,920 --> 00:27:28,240
Fu, you…

427
00:27:42,200 --> 00:27:43,280
Aunt,

428
00:27:43,840 --> 00:27:46,040
you haven't had
anything to eat or drink all day.

429
00:27:46,120 --> 00:27:47,720
Please have some.

430
00:27:54,680 --> 00:27:58,200
EMPRESS

431
00:27:59,920 --> 00:28:03,560
EMPRESS DOWAGER

432
00:28:07,240 --> 00:28:08,320
Aunt.

433
00:28:16,800 --> 00:28:19,360
Mother, you don't need to worry anymore.

434
00:28:19,880 --> 00:28:21,960
His Majesty has
already pardoned Prince Rong.

435
00:28:22,880 --> 00:28:24,000
What?

436
00:28:25,920 --> 00:28:27,280
His Majesty pardoned Xiao?

437
00:28:29,160 --> 00:28:30,320
That's not right.

438
00:28:30,400 --> 00:28:36,800
Earlier, he was furious
and determined to punish Xiao severely.

439
00:28:36,880 --> 00:28:40,040
How could he suddenly change his mind?

440
00:28:40,640 --> 00:28:44,120
We have Lady Li to thank for that.
Thanks to her persuasive words,

441
00:28:44,800 --> 00:28:46,680
His Majesty changed his mind.

442
00:28:47,320 --> 00:28:51,680
What good intentions
could the scheming temptress have?

443
00:28:52,480 --> 00:28:55,200
It's just to curry favor with you, Aunt.

444
00:28:55,800 --> 00:28:57,680
Who asked you to be out of favor?

445
00:28:57,760 --> 00:29:00,880
Pulling a long face all day,
even I hate looking at it,

446
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:03,280
let alone the Emperor.

447
00:29:03,360 --> 00:29:08,160
If you won his heart, you should be
the one today to reconcile those brothers

448
00:29:09,680 --> 00:29:11,680
It should have been your duty
as the Empress.

449
00:29:11,760 --> 00:29:16,560
That is only because I come from your clan

450
00:29:17,600 --> 00:29:19,600
and was handpicked by you,

451
00:29:20,400 --> 00:29:22,400
which displeases His Majesty in every way.

452
00:29:22,480 --> 00:29:24,280
Empress, you had better hold your tongue.

453
00:29:24,800 --> 00:29:28,560
Lady Li persuaded His Majesty
to restore fraternal harmony

454
00:29:28,640 --> 00:29:30,040
which is a good thing after all.

455
00:29:30,640 --> 00:29:32,640
Will you be happy if brothers
become sworn enemies

456
00:29:32,720 --> 00:29:34,920
and Mother couldn't eat?

457
00:29:38,720 --> 00:29:40,720
Empress Dowager, His Majesty
sent an edict.

458
00:29:48,080 --> 00:29:51,200
IMPERIAL EDICT

459
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:54,920
To show special favor to Lady Li,

460
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:56,320
His Majesty bestows her
the title of Lady of Bright Deportment,

461
00:29:56,400 --> 00:29:58,240
meaning "manifesting virtue".

462
00:29:58,320 --> 00:30:00,280
The title equals that of the Chancellor.

463
00:30:00,360 --> 00:30:02,760
The rank equals to a feudal king,
governing all consorts,

464
00:30:02,840 --> 00:30:04,320
second only to the Empress.

465
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:05,800
The imperial edict was
delivered to Changle Palace,

466
00:30:05,880 --> 00:30:07,520
and the Empress Dowager approved it.

467
00:30:07,600 --> 00:30:10,000
The formal decree will be issued tomorrow.

468
00:30:13,080 --> 00:30:16,120
Congratulations,
Lady of Bright Deportment.

469
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:27,520
ZHAOYANG PALACE

470
00:30:27,600 --> 00:30:30,200
Lady Li of Bright Deportment.

471
00:30:30,880 --> 00:30:33,280
Yinggu, you are always the most composed.

472
00:30:33,360 --> 00:30:35,160
What has panicked you so?

473
00:30:36,800 --> 00:30:39,680
Could it be that my mother is unwell?

474
00:30:39,760 --> 00:30:41,120
Lady Li, please dismiss everyone.

475
00:30:41,200 --> 00:30:43,320
I have a matter of
grave importance to report.

476
00:30:55,400 --> 00:30:56,320
Wei Rao.

477
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:04,280
I haven't thanked you yet, My Lord,
for defending me in the palace.

478
00:31:06,520 --> 00:31:07,600
Grandmother said,

479
00:31:08,320 --> 00:31:11,160
since you fought for all
the compensation from the Hans,

480
00:31:11,920 --> 00:31:13,000
it's all yours to handle.

481
00:31:14,360 --> 00:31:15,440
Understood.

482
00:31:17,800 --> 00:31:19,400
How do you plan to handle those things?

483
00:31:22,440 --> 00:31:25,280
Even if Han Liao
honestly hands over the deeds,

484
00:31:26,080 --> 00:31:27,440
to make them truly belong to you,

485
00:31:28,240 --> 00:31:30,640
you must go to
the relevant offices to re-deed them

486
00:31:30,720 --> 00:31:31,560
and transfer tax obligations.

487
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:33,400
There are many details involved.

488
00:31:34,520 --> 00:31:36,320
- If you need help…
- No need to trouble you.

489
00:31:37,920 --> 00:31:38,960
I have my own help.

490
00:31:47,320 --> 00:31:49,000
Transferring tax deeds
is quite troublesome.

491
00:31:49,080 --> 00:31:50,800
I wonder who she asked for help.

492
00:31:52,640 --> 00:31:54,160
Her next husband, of course.

493
00:31:55,960 --> 00:31:57,000
Husband…

494
00:31:58,920 --> 00:31:59,920
Husband?

495
00:32:07,520 --> 00:32:09,800
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

496
00:32:28,520 --> 00:32:31,080
- Does it look good?
- It looks really good.

497
00:32:31,160 --> 00:32:33,160
As beautiful as a celestial fairy.

498
00:32:34,040 --> 00:32:36,080
Bitao, what do you think?

499
00:32:36,760 --> 00:32:38,720
The finest silk in the world

500
00:32:39,240 --> 00:32:43,880
and the most luxurious jewels
cannot compare to your radiance.

501
00:32:44,600 --> 00:32:49,120
In my heart,
even in coarse linen without adornment,

502
00:32:49,640 --> 00:32:52,560
you are still you,
as grand as ever, My Lady.

503
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:07,000
Let's go.

504
00:33:17,560 --> 00:33:18,880
I won't need you to follow today.

505
00:33:21,560 --> 00:33:22,640
My Lady…

506
00:33:50,320 --> 00:33:51,280
This way.

507
00:34:00,280 --> 00:34:01,640
Imperial decrees are hard to disobey.

508
00:34:01,720 --> 00:34:05,200
Even someone as noble as Lord Han
has to serve a full month of hard labor.

509
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:08,320
Doing hard labor by day
and guarding the gate by night.

510
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:11,040
- Get lost!
- Look.

511
00:34:11,960 --> 00:34:12,880
He's right over there.

512
00:34:23,639 --> 00:34:25,760
You look so miserable, Lord Han.

513
00:34:27,840 --> 00:34:29,520
Isn't this all thanks to you?

514
00:34:29,600 --> 00:34:30,880
Is it?

515
00:34:31,840 --> 00:34:32,960
Not at all.

516
00:34:33,800 --> 00:34:35,239
It's all my own doing.

517
00:34:35,320 --> 00:34:37,040
I can't blame you, Lady Wei Rao.

518
00:34:37,120 --> 00:34:39,239
Who are you to call her Lady Wei Rao?

519
00:34:39,320 --> 00:34:41,480
You call her that and I am not allowed?

520
00:34:42,800 --> 00:34:45,239
I am no friend to Lu Zhuo.

521
00:34:46,360 --> 00:34:47,639
Not my place to call her my buddy's wife.

522
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:51,080
"Sister-in-law" isn't right either.

523
00:34:51,719 --> 00:34:54,040
Lu Zhuo's out of my league
to be a brother.

524
00:34:56,280 --> 00:34:58,440
Better to call you Lady Wei Rao.

525
00:34:58,520 --> 00:34:59,400
Friendly enough.

526
00:35:01,120 --> 00:35:02,760
You still got the energy to argue, I see.

527
00:35:03,280 --> 00:35:05,440
It seems this work is too easy.

528
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:07,480
I knew you'd come.

529
00:35:08,080 --> 00:35:10,240
I wouldn't pass up a chance

530
00:35:10,760 --> 00:35:12,360
to kick someone when they're down either.

531
00:35:13,640 --> 00:35:15,280
So I prepared in advance.

532
00:35:16,080 --> 00:35:16,920
Men.

533
00:35:25,720 --> 00:35:27,560
The deeds for 500 mu of good farmland,

534
00:35:28,080 --> 00:35:30,640
for my grand estate
at the foot of Mount Yaowang,

535
00:35:30,720 --> 00:35:32,120
and the indentures for 300 servants.

536
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:34,000
They are all here.

537
00:35:34,080 --> 00:35:37,040
This is property confiscated
from your family.

538
00:35:37,120 --> 00:35:38,560
Handing it over is only right.

539
00:35:39,080 --> 00:35:39,960
Saves me the trouble.

540
00:35:40,040 --> 00:35:41,520
<i>Higher.</i>

541
00:35:42,240 --> 00:35:44,320
I sincerely gift all of
this to you, Lady Wei Rao.

542
00:35:45,360 --> 00:35:46,880
I've handled all official procedures.

543
00:35:47,560 --> 00:35:48,920
You just need to take ownership.

544
00:35:49,000 --> 00:35:50,160
LAND DEED

545
00:35:50,840 --> 00:35:52,160
Such a grand gesture.

546
00:35:53,920 --> 00:35:56,320
You parted with
your wealth so readily, Lord Han.

547
00:35:56,960 --> 00:35:58,320
Are you asking me for a favor?

548
00:36:03,480 --> 00:36:05,800
Parting with wealth is temporary pain,

549
00:36:05,880 --> 00:36:08,440
unlike this hard labor
that grinds a man down.

550
00:36:08,520 --> 00:36:10,160
After just one day,

551
00:36:10,240 --> 00:36:12,920
my shoulders and back are covered in cuts.

552
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:16,000
The soles of my feet are raw too.

553
00:36:17,840 --> 00:36:21,360
If I really do this for a month,
I'm afraid I won't be recognizable.

554
00:36:21,440 --> 00:36:26,520
So, I ask that you
be willing to intercede on my behalf.

555
00:36:27,640 --> 00:36:32,200
Just a word. I only need one word
to spare me from this hard labor.

556
00:36:33,520 --> 00:36:35,720
And I will reward you handsomely.

557
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:37,040
You're dreaming.

558
00:36:39,800 --> 00:36:42,160
What handsome reward?

559
00:36:44,320 --> 00:36:45,160
Please.

560
00:36:51,560 --> 00:36:52,640
This is…

561
00:37:03,280 --> 00:37:06,240
My redemption money.
Spare me from hard labor,

562
00:37:07,040 --> 00:37:08,440
and all this is yours.

563
00:37:20,160 --> 00:37:22,840
All of these…

564
00:37:38,280 --> 00:37:41,960
Only fine jewels like these
are worthy of a beauty like you.

565
00:37:43,360 --> 00:37:46,360
Rest assured, you won't
need to labor or run about.

566
00:37:46,440 --> 00:37:48,560
You just need to pass
a word to Attendant Liu over there.

567
00:37:48,640 --> 00:37:51,640
Say you've forgiven me
and our families have reconciled.

568
00:37:51,720 --> 00:37:52,920
This matter will be settled.

569
00:37:53,000 --> 00:37:55,480
Such flawless pearls.

570
00:37:57,200 --> 00:37:59,000
Such beautiful gold.

571
00:38:00,480 --> 00:38:05,240
How did you know
that my favorite thing in life is gold?

572
00:38:07,920 --> 00:38:08,760
HENGCHENG GATE

573
00:38:08,840 --> 00:38:12,840
Trinkets, small ornaments, come look.

574
00:38:14,240 --> 00:38:15,680
- It's mine!
- Hurry!

575
00:38:15,760 --> 00:38:16,680
You…

576
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:19,640
Wei Rao, what are you doing?

577
00:38:20,240 --> 00:38:21,360
Give it to me.

578
00:38:22,000 --> 00:38:22,840
Mine.

579
00:38:23,600 --> 00:38:24,680
Give it to me.

580
00:38:41,880 --> 00:38:43,080
What?

581
00:38:43,720 --> 00:38:45,680
Since it's mine,
I can do as I please with it.

582
00:38:48,080 --> 00:38:49,920
Can't bear to part with it, Lord Han?

583
00:38:57,200 --> 00:38:58,240
It's up to you.

584
00:39:04,360 --> 00:39:09,120
- Give it to me.
- It's mine.

585
00:39:09,200 --> 00:39:12,200
A bit of gold and silver
to make a beauty smile.

586
00:39:12,280 --> 00:39:13,200
It's worth it.

587
00:39:14,120 --> 00:39:15,320
As long as you're happy,

588
00:39:16,880 --> 00:39:17,760
throw it.

589
00:39:19,600 --> 00:39:23,120
General Qi, please convert all the gold
and silver in the chest into grain,

590
00:39:23,200 --> 00:39:26,120
send it to the city charity center,
and have them set up porridge stalls.

591
00:39:27,480 --> 00:39:28,560
At your service.

592
00:39:34,840 --> 00:39:36,960
500 mu of good farmland.

593
00:39:40,920 --> 00:39:42,760
Everyone in the capital knows

594
00:39:42,840 --> 00:39:45,000
that the area below
Mount Yaowang was originally a wasteland.

595
00:39:45,680 --> 00:39:48,080
Destitute refugees gathered there,

596
00:39:48,800 --> 00:39:51,800
and they reclaimed fertile fields
on the barren land.

597
00:39:51,880 --> 00:39:55,320
Your family
lent them seeds and farm tools,

598
00:39:56,920 --> 00:39:58,680
but before the wheat could even ripen,

599
00:39:58,760 --> 00:40:01,400
it was all seized by
high-ranking officials and nobles.

600
00:40:02,200 --> 00:40:04,400
The Han family took all the good farmland.

601
00:40:04,480 --> 00:40:05,720
Free men ended up as tenant.

602
00:40:06,400 --> 00:40:08,080
90% of the grain
they worked so hard to farm

603
00:40:08,160 --> 00:40:10,200
had to be handed over to you.

604
00:40:13,920 --> 00:40:17,200
Han family's good farmland?

605
00:40:18,560 --> 00:40:19,640
What a joke.

606
00:40:20,560 --> 00:40:23,560
Do you even know what you are tearing up
and throwing away?

607
00:40:23,640 --> 00:40:26,240
The wealth belongs to you.

608
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:29,360
Your land and your slaves. All yours.

609
00:40:30,240 --> 00:40:32,720
How could you destroy it yourself?

610
00:40:32,800 --> 00:40:34,840
- You…
- As I said,

611
00:40:35,680 --> 00:40:37,160
all tenant farmers are set free.

612
00:40:38,600 --> 00:40:43,160
Whoever tills the soil and grows the food,
the grain should rightfully be theirs.

613
00:40:51,640 --> 00:40:54,840
Father, I saw a glazed hairpin
yesterday that I really like.

614
00:40:54,920 --> 00:40:56,400
It only cost 1,500 qian.

615
00:40:56,480 --> 00:40:59,560
Alright, whatever my good girl likes,
I will buy it for you.

616
00:40:59,640 --> 00:41:01,280
Father, you are the best.

617
00:41:02,040 --> 00:41:03,120
Yesterday, I washed clothes
at your residence.

618
00:41:03,200 --> 00:41:04,840
My pay was short by one qian.

619
00:41:04,920 --> 00:41:06,280
Please bestow it upon me, Lord.

620
00:41:06,360 --> 00:41:09,400
Nonsense! When did I ever
withhold your pay? Get lost.

621
00:41:10,440 --> 00:41:11,360
It really was short by one qian.

622
00:41:11,440 --> 00:41:13,360
Without money for medicine,
my mother will die.

623
00:41:14,240 --> 00:41:15,120
Drag her away.

624
00:41:17,160 --> 00:41:19,480
Lord. My Lord!

625
00:41:19,560 --> 00:41:20,400
ZHUANG'S HOUSE

626
00:41:32,240 --> 00:41:33,480
You people…

627
00:41:33,560 --> 00:41:36,320
For pearls and fine jade
and lavish enjoyments,

628
00:41:36,400 --> 00:41:38,440
you won't hesitate to spend gold.

629
00:41:40,200 --> 00:41:43,280
Yet before the truly impoverished,

630
00:41:43,360 --> 00:41:45,440
even for what's rightfully theirs,

631
00:41:46,560 --> 00:41:49,920
you can be so stingy.
Not one penny spent, not one inch given.

632
00:41:52,520 --> 00:41:55,560
Even after working day and night,
rushing about in hardship,

633
00:41:56,160 --> 00:41:58,320
they remain destitute,

634
00:41:59,760 --> 00:42:01,440
dying of exhaustion and hunger.

635
00:42:04,600 --> 00:42:06,000
How pitiful.

636
00:42:07,040 --> 00:42:08,840
How ridiculous.

637
00:42:12,440 --> 00:42:14,280
How terrifying.

638
00:42:17,760 --> 00:42:18,920
Off you go!

639
00:42:26,320 --> 00:42:27,280
Something coming down.

640
00:42:28,160 --> 00:42:30,040
- What is this?
- What is it?

641
00:42:30,120 --> 00:42:31,320
This is mine.

642
00:42:34,600 --> 00:42:36,440
Out of the way, it is all mine!

643
00:42:37,440 --> 00:42:38,480
Hurry!

644
00:42:38,560 --> 00:42:42,440
Goddess of mercy! A true saint!

645
00:42:45,040 --> 00:42:47,240
- Stop, that's mine.
- It's mine.

646
00:42:47,320 --> 00:42:49,920
- Let go.
- Don't tear it, it's mine.

647
00:42:57,000 --> 00:42:58,080
What is all this?

648
00:43:02,760 --> 00:43:04,280
You are all free now.

649
00:43:11,760 --> 00:43:13,720
- I got it.
- It's mine.

650
00:43:13,800 --> 00:43:15,320
Just grab it first.

651
00:43:16,520 --> 00:43:19,160
It's all mine. Get out of the way.

652
00:43:19,240 --> 00:43:23,320
- It's all mine.
- It's all mine.

653
00:43:23,920 --> 00:43:25,040
It's a land deed.

654
00:43:25,960 --> 00:43:27,040
She tore the land deed to pieces.

655
00:43:31,400 --> 00:43:34,360
Estates, farmland, pearls, gold, and jade…

656
00:43:35,280 --> 00:43:40,560
She actually gave up things
many could only dream of.

657
00:43:42,280 --> 00:43:43,400
Lunatic.

658
00:43:43,480 --> 00:43:47,080
She is an absolute lunatic.

659
00:43:52,000 --> 00:43:54,880
However, no matter how bold she is,

660
00:43:54,960 --> 00:43:56,160
how crazy she is,

661
00:43:57,640 --> 00:43:59,800
she has reached a dead end today.

662
00:44:18,720 --> 00:44:21,360
- What are you crying for?
- My Lord…

663
00:44:22,600 --> 00:44:25,160
I am asking you. What are you crying for?

664
00:44:35,000 --> 00:44:36,000
Where is her jewelry?

665
00:44:36,600 --> 00:44:40,360
She gave half to me
and took all the rest with her.

666
00:44:43,760 --> 00:44:44,800
What is she doing?

667
00:44:47,600 --> 00:44:48,640
You…

668
00:44:48,720 --> 00:44:50,480
My Lord,
everyone in the capital is talking.

669
00:44:50,560 --> 00:44:51,680
Madam tore up the land deeds
from the Han family

670
00:44:51,760 --> 00:44:53,440
and freed all the tenant farmers.

671
00:44:53,520 --> 00:44:55,120
She sold the estate,
gold, and silver for grain

672
00:44:55,200 --> 00:44:56,640
and gave it all to the refugees.

673
00:45:04,360 --> 00:45:05,600
She's never coming back.

674
00:45:08,080 --> 00:45:08,920
Right?

675
00:45:15,080 --> 00:45:16,160
Wishful thinking.

676
00:45:16,840 --> 00:45:19,200
Zhao Song, where is she?

677
00:45:19,280 --> 00:45:21,280
She should be at the charity centre now.

678
00:45:29,400 --> 00:45:31,800
Prepare the horses.
Let's leave the city now.

679
00:45:31,880 --> 00:45:33,600
My Lord, aren't you
looking for her Ladyship?

680
00:45:33,680 --> 00:45:34,800
Why leave the city?

681
00:45:35,480 --> 00:45:38,000
To bring her back,
we must go to Mount Yaowang.

682
00:45:44,840 --> 00:45:47,000
You should've seen Han Liao's face.

683
00:45:47,080 --> 00:45:48,960
Ripping his heart out wouldn't hurt more.

684
00:45:49,040 --> 00:45:50,000
Can't believe you just did it.

685
00:45:50,080 --> 00:45:53,960
Then again, who wouldn't love wealth,
lands, and slaves?

686
00:45:54,480 --> 00:45:56,560
In this world,
only you could give them up.

687
00:45:59,520 --> 00:46:01,440
Qi Zhongkai, thank you.

688
00:46:02,480 --> 00:46:04,560
No need for thanks
between us. You know that I…

689
00:46:08,400 --> 00:46:09,680
SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

690
00:46:16,640 --> 00:46:18,040
The guest I'm waiting for

691
00:46:21,560 --> 00:46:22,400
has arrived.

692
00:46:25,320 --> 00:46:28,520
- Who goes there?
- General, they look like palace guards.

693
00:46:31,160 --> 00:46:33,760
SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

694
00:46:36,720 --> 00:46:38,560
My mistress invites you tonight.

695
00:46:39,320 --> 00:46:41,440
Please board the carriage, Lady Lu.

696
00:46:57,600 --> 00:46:59,560
The moment I stepped out of the palace,

697
00:47:00,200 --> 00:47:01,800
I knew this day would come.

698
00:47:02,880 --> 00:47:03,720
General Qi,

699
00:47:05,280 --> 00:47:06,240
thank you for today.

700
00:47:07,520 --> 00:47:08,640
Wei Rao.

701
00:47:09,680 --> 00:47:10,880
I have personal matters to handle.

702
00:47:11,560 --> 00:47:12,880
I would ask the General
not to inquire further.

703
00:49:36,880 --> 00:49:39,560
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
